<section class="view" id="view-settings">
  <div class="card" id="dataBackupCard"><h3>Local Data Protection</h3><div style="font-size:10px;color:#858e9f;line-height:1.6">Invoice Studio stores your invoices, clients and settings in the local SQLite database. Draft work is also autosaved so a refresh does not erase what you were entering.</div><div style="display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:10px"><button class="btn" type="button" onclick="exportStudioBackup()">Export Data Backup</button><label class="btn" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;cursor:pointer">Import Data Backup<input type="file" accept=".json,application/json" onchange="importStudioBackup(event)" style="display:none"></label></div><small id="storageStatus" style="display:block;color:#6f7888;margin-top:8px"></small></div>
  <div class="grid2">
